tle pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">Don't like them go bang.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang..png/revision/latest?cb=20210321095523\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Don&#39;t like them go bang.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095523\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20210321095523 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/d/d6/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/536?cb=20210321095523 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Don&#39;t like them go bang.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"Don%27t_like_them_go_bang..png\" data-image-name=\"Don&#39;t like them go bang..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">9</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">9</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Shaqinahat.\" title=\"Shaqinahat.\">Shaqinahat.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/Think_about_the_spirit.\" title=\"Think about the spirit.\">Think about the spirit.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>Don't like them go bang.</b></i> is the ninth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_9\" title=\"Series 9\">Series 9</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Dave\" title=\"Dave\">Dave</a> on 30 October 2019. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>\"Don’t like them go bang\" was how <a href=\"/wiki/Greg_Davies\" title=\"Greg Davies\">Greg Davies</a> paraphrased something <a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\">David Baddiel</a> said during the <a href=\"/wiki/Inflate,_tie_and_pop_as_many_balloons_as_possible_in_ten_minutes\" title=\"Inflate, tie and pop as many balloons as possible in ten minutes\">Inflate, tie and pop as many balloons as possible in ten minutes</a> task. What he actually said was \"I don't like popping balloons. I mean, bang them. Make them go bang.\" The title card is an elbow, referencing <a href=\"/wiki/Make_either_a_knee_and_an_elbow,_a_knee_and_a_knee_or_an_elbow_or_an_elbow_look_like_a_famous_couple\" title=\"Make either a knee and an elbow, a knee and a knee or an elbow or an elbow look like a famous couple\">Make either a knee and an elbow, a knee and a knee or an elbow or an elbow look like a famous couple</a>.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Denmark's TV2 Play streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Ikke fedt, når de siger bang', which translates as 'Not cool, when they go bang'.</li>\n<li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'En tykkää paukkeesta', which translates as 'I don't like the bang'.</li>\n<li>On Norway's Discovery+ Norge streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Jeg liker ikke når det sier pang', which translates as 'I don't like when it says bang'. Note: this Norwegian translation of the title only appears in the subtitles for the episode, whereas the episode title listed on the platform is the original English title.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/Don%27t_like_them_go_bang.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/David_Baddiel\" title=\"David Baddiel\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">David Baddiel</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ed_Gamble\" title=\"Ed Gamble\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ed Gamble</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jo_Brand\" title=\"Jo Brand\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jo Brand</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Katy_Wix\" title=\"Katy Wix\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Katy Wix</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Rose_Matafeo\" title=\"Rose Matafeo\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Rose Matafeo</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Most_desirable_smooth_thing\" title=\"Most desirable smooth thing\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Most desirable smooth thing.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Give_Alex_a_five-word_instruction_in_the_most_spy-like_way\" title=\"Give Alex a five-word instruction in the most spy-like way\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Give Alex a five-word instruction in the most spy-like way. You must not be seen or heard communicating with Alex in any way.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Inflate,_tie_and_pop_as_many_balloons_as_possible_in_ten_minutes\" title=\"Inflate, tie and pop as many balloons as possible in ten minutes\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Inflate, tie and pop as many balloons as possible in ten minutes. Once you pop your first balloon, you may not inflate any more balloons. If any balloons are still inflated after ten minutes, you are disqualified. Most popped balloons wins. Also, you may not look at a clock or any sort of timing device at any point.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Make_either_a_knee_and_an_elbow,_a_knee_and_a_knee_or_an_elbow_or_an_elbow_look_like_a_famous_couple\" title=\"Make either a knee and an elbow, a knee and a knee or an elbow or an elbow look like a famous couple\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Make either a knee and an elbow, a knee and a knee or an elbow or an elbow look like a famous couple. You must only use your knees and elbows.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Standing_in_a_queue,_draw_the_most_accurate_pictures\" title=\"Standing in a queue, draw the most accurate pictures\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Standing in a queue, draw the most accurate pictures. Alex will show the person at the back of the queue a picture. The person at the back of the queue must draw this picture on the back of the person in front of them. The person at the front of the queue must draw the picture they think has been drawn on the back of their pad. No-one may communicate with anyone else.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\"><b>19</b>\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>14\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td>\n<td>17\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"